OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested as 'small explosive
OL,4,Adevices' made safe
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and a woman have been arrested
OL,7,Fafter three "small homemade explosive
OL,8,Fdevices" were discovered and "safely
OL,9,Fdealt with" at a property in Essex.
OL,11,FPolice forced entry to a home on
OL,12,FSawyers Grove, Brentwood, at about
OL,13,F07:20 GMT, following reports of a
OL,14,Fdisturbance.
OL,16,FThe discovery of the suspicious items
OL,17,Fled to bomb disposal experts being
OL,18,Fcalled and a 100m (328ft) cordon being
OL,19,Fput in place, with 40 properties
OL,20,Fevacuated.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
