OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested as 'small explosive
OL,4,Adevices' made safe
OL,5,
OL,6,FEssex Police said the arrested pair, in
OL,7,Ftheir 40s and from Brentwood, remained
OL,8,Fin custody for questioning on suspicion
OL,9,Fof offences under the Explosive
OL,10,FSubstances Act.
